# RC-02 · Cabeceras que revelan información del servidor (intencional).
<IfModule mod_headers.c>
    Header always set X-Powered-By "PHP/5.6.40"
    Header always set X-Backend-Server "srv-old-portal01 (Apache/2.2.15 CentOS)"
    Header always set X-Deploy "migracion-2024-03 ; staging habilitado"
</IfModule>
